小路",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="这里是平安小镇的碎石路，道路宽敞而笔直。",left="hdroom1811",right="hdroom1818",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1818={id="hdroom1818",name="碎石小路",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="这里是平安小镇的碎石路，道路宽敞而笔直。",left="hdroom1817",right="hdroom1819",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1819={id="hdroom1819",name="小镇西口",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="一大清早，小镇村口早已人来人往：挑担赶路的，驾牛车送货的，赶着毛驴拉货车的——络绎不绝，齐齐赶向小镇的新春集会。无论是牛车还是驴车，上面都装满各式各样的年货；村民们你争我喊，似是要将自己的年货和别人的年货分个高低。",left="hdroom1818",right="hdroom1820",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"318001",5}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom1818","hdroom1819"}}}},autoResult1={{type="gaintab",args={"318001",6}},{type="doc",args={"YEL王庚金：时候不早了，少侠同我一起去客栈一趟吧，也正好就到客栈歇歇脚。NOR"}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1820={id="hdroom1820",name="平安大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="新春清晨，朝露还未晞，朝阳还未完全升起，平安大街的人们各个都很有活力。街旁的车马行的生意变得异常火热，无论是本地镇民还是外地来客，纷纷在车马行停车下马卸货，随后又马不停蹄地赶往另外的街区，导致平安大街上一片拥挤。",left="hdroom1819",right="hdroom1821",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1821={id="hdroom1821",name="平安西街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="正是今年风景美，千红万紫报春光。新春佳节，平安西街两旁的各色店铺大门敞开，首饰店和铁匠铺趁着新春推出了新的货品，一时之间，貌美如花的姑娘们，英武不凡的侠客们，分别将首饰店和铁匠铺围得水泄不通，让店家掌柜招呼不及。",left="hdroom1820",right="hdroom1822",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1822={id="hdroom1822",name="中央广场",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="龙飞凤舞万象新，腾达天地处处春。在这处处热闹喧嚣的新春之际，中央广场作为小镇的中心，自然是镇中最为繁荣的地段。两边的屋宇店肆鳞次栉比，高高飘扬的商铺招牌旗帜，粼粼而来的车马，川流不息的行人，一齐描绘了一幅喜庆的平安新春盛景。",up="hdroom1823",left="hdroom1821",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"318001",6}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom1821","hdroom1822"}}}},autoResult1={{type="gaintab",args={"318001",7}},{type="doc",args={"YEL王庚金：客栈是在北大街里新开的一家，内里铺陈都还不错，就是价格贵了点。NOR"}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1823={id="hdroom1823",name="北大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="莺啼燕语报新年，马邑龙堆路几千。又是一年新春，南归的燕子啄起春泥，在屋檐下筑起新巢，几只黄莺飞上初透嫩绿的小草和柳梢。燕归来，莺语乱，街上人声喧闹，似是在歌咏春天的来到。",up="hdroom1824",down="hdroom1822",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1824={id="hdroom1824",name="北大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="莺啼燕语报新年，马邑龙堆路几千。又是一年新春，南归的燕子啄起春泥，在屋檐下筑起新巢，几只黄莺飞上初透嫩绿的小草和柳梢。燕归来，莺语乱，街上人声喧闹，似是在歌咏春天的来到。",down="hdroom1823",left="hdroom1825",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1825={id="hdroom1825",name="聚财客栈",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="小镇内新开的一间客栈，掌柜的是周遭闻名的富商，内里铺陈气派非凡，在附近名声鹊起。",right="hdroom1824",roomRoles={"rw14"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"318001",7}}}},autoResult1={{type="doc",